    "Detailed step/epoch/compactJSONL/CSV/text reports measuredCE/LR/gradients/channelG/orderD/sourceV/time/memory. InactiveG/D metrics are N/A,never fabricated0. MAC conv/matmul only,not totalFLOPs. Negativeoutcomes preserved.",
    "Span uses centered normalized classifier-weight ridge mapping (ridge1e-3),not exact orthogonal projection. Anchor uses separately normalized base plus bounded response,without final joint L2. Both237147params; no new optimizer/loss; raw and used response telemetry separated. Equalized=1 receivedIQ; no claim of arbitrarymultipath invariance. Geometry evidence is source-only; no target-derived hypothesis.",
